{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE3L0JlJTIwQWZyYWlkJTIwJTI4MjAxNyUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Be Afraid","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nCDyv3YRKwIuLi9o0k88Ntu9ala.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4iisYwckDPFkfvWDSkrROETILYG.jpg","description":"Not long after John Chambers and his family arrive at their new home in a small country town of Pennsylvania, John begins to experience sleep paralysis. Lying there paralyzed, trapped within his own nightmare, other-worldly beings visit John. They are entities which exist in the darkest shadows of the night and can only be seen out of the corner of one's eye. These encounters begin to haunt John, transforming to complete terror as he discovers the entities' sole purpose... the abduction of his seven year old son. In the end, John will uncover the town's horrific secret, a portal on his land, and make one last attempt to save his son before the shadow people permanently take him away to their world.\n\nRated 18 · Released 26 Apr 2017 · United States of America · Language: English · 99 min\nStudio: Quest Pacifica, DarkShed\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["Horror","Mystery","Thriller","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.0","imdb_id":"tt3311020","moviedb_id":448252,"tmdbId":448252,"runtime":"99 min","cast":["Brian Krause","Jaimi Paige","Louis Herthum","Jared Abrahamson","Michelle Hurd","Michael Leone","Noell Coet","Sade Kimora Young"],"director":["Drew Gabreski"],"writer":["Gerald Nott"],"released":"2017-04-26T00:00:00.000Z","country":"United States of America","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Drew Gabreski","character":"Director"},{"name":"Brian Krause","character":"Dr. John Chambers","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jW2vwTvcJAGxbiWMXD3p065Lhs1.jpg"},{"name":"Jaimi Paige","character":"Heather Chambers","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5RJe5wHYnSVJCLkMUDWT9X8Wnfc.jpg"},{"name":"Louis Hert